work_units.notes:
Make the default workflow explicit:
  - result count and active filters;
  - filter controls;
  - result rows;
  - row limit;
  - row detail action;
  - CSV/JSON export.

Move schema and power-user controls behind secondary affordances:
  - Visible Columns;
  - SQL scratchpad;
  - Build SQL From Filters;
  - starter SQL queries.

Align Query table formatting with browse pages:
  - ms values and seconds values use deliberate units;
  - power score and geomean values use consistent precision;
  - dates avoid awkward wrapping at desktop width;
  - null, missing, no-run, and not-recorded values have distinct display;
  - metric direction is visible where benchmark values appear.
